=== GC0 dilution (no source) ===
  N_e =  0: physical charge density x exp(-3 N_e) = 1.000e+00   (KA6: no dilution)
  N_e = 50: physical charge density x exp(-3 N_e) = 7.175e-66
  N_e = 60: physical charge density x exp(-3 N_e) = 6.714e-79
  N_e = 70: physical charge density x exp(-3 N_e) = 6.283e-92

=== GC1 numerical check of the identity through inflation -> radiation -> matter (H_I = 1, a_end = 1) ===
  ln a =  -60: a^3 n/gamma =  0.000000e+00   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  0.000000e+00   n/(8 gamma H^3) =  0.000000
  ln a =  -30: a^3 n/gamma =  6.555210e-39   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  6.555210e-39   n/(8 gamma H^3) =  1.000000
  ln a =   -5: a^3 n/gamma =  2.447219e-06   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  2.447219e-06   n/(8 gamma H^3) =  1.000000
  ln a =    0: a^3 n/gamma =  2.828431e+00   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  2.828431e+00   n/(8 gamma H^3) =  1.000000
  ln a =    2: a^3 n/gamma =  1.982026e-02   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  1.982026e-02   n/(8 gamma H^3) =  1.000000
  ln a =    5: a^3 n/gamma =  2.447739e-06   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  2.447763e-06   n/(8 gamma H^3) =  0.999990
  ln a =   10: a^3 n/gamma = -2.365117e-11   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  7.734794e-13   n/(8 gamma H^3) = -30.577633
  ln a =   14: a^3 n/gamma = -2.442463e-11   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  1.503580e-17   n/(8 gamma H^3) = -1624432.173533
  ln a =   20: a^3 n/gamma = -2.442465e-11   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  7.509255e-22   n/(8 gamma H^3) = -32526059107.114185
  ln a =   25: a^3 n/gamma = -2.442465e-11   identity 8[(aH)^3 - (aH)^3_start] =  4.140530e-25   n/(8 gamma H^3) = -58989179250302.570312
  late a^3 n/gamma at ln a = 25: -2.442e-11 = -8.64e-12 of the peak 8 (aH)^3_end = 2.8284; identity says  4.141e-25
    rtol 1e-08: late value  5.977e-12 (sign and size move with the tolerance and stay ~1e-12 of the peak: integration error, not a lasting charge)
    rtol 1e-12: late value -3.335e-12 (sign and size move with the tolerance and stay ~1e-12 of the peak: integration error, not a lasting charge)
  => the lasting comoving charge made by the term is zero to the integrator's accuracy; the only lasting piece is the pre-inflation offset C = a_i^3 (n_i - 8 gamma H_I^3), diluted by e^(-3 N_e)
  MU1b switched coupling (off at a_end): lasting a^3 n/gamma = 2.7632  (8 (aH)^3 at a_end = 2.8284 in this smooth history: the gate moves; a lasting charge appears only with a switch, a new ingredient)

=== GC1 Arm I: what R the plain term gives, and what it would need ===
 [canonical] H0 = 2.1843e-18 /s, Omega_d = 0.2661, R target 5.41
   lasting dust from the term = 0 + (pre-inflation offset) x e^(-3 N_e): R_term = 0 for every gamma, H_I, T_reh; R stays the free constant C / rho_b0 (one constant, as before; gamma adds none to dust)
   most generous reading 8 gamma H0^3 = rho_d0 -> ell_A = 3 Omega_d/(16 H0) = 2.2845e+16 s = 222.0 Mpc
 GC3 cold at ell_A: the term's density n_GB = 8 gamma H^3; w_eff = -1 - dlnH/dlna
   w_eff at z 3400 = 0.749 vs line <= 0.01 -> factor 75; matter era w = 1/2, radiation w = 1; MU3: an a^-3 component gives w = 0.0
   net Friedmann contribution of the term = -16 gamma H^3 = -2 x rho_d0 today at ell_A: NEGATIVE energy
 GC5 tensor speed: c_T^2 = (1 + 16 ell Qdot)/(1 + 16 ell H Q), Q ~ 1, Qdot ~ 0
